<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Komercni to auction 6-mth C-paper April 16.</title>
<headline>Czech Komercni to auction 6-mth C-paper April 16.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Komercni Banka a.s., the Czech Republic's largest commercial bank, on Thursday said it would auction an unspecified tranche of six-month commercial paper on April 16.</p>
<p>In a published statement the bank said the paper would have a nominal value of one million crowns.</p>
<p>The bank said it would release further details of the issue two days before the auction.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
